+## Readiness status (2026-10-06, producer)
+
+Harness corrected after preview-run-1 (historical failed run preserved in
+runtime/shaft/preview-run-1): exact-float seek now uses transient step=any with
+the native value setter plus real input/change events; S2 implements the October 6
+retained-partial-stock contract (telemetry counts vs live progression uniforms,
+wholly-return no-advance/no-engagement, per-gain counted-engagement causality,
+previous-pass depth ahead of the cutter leading face); restore snapshots are
